{"chapter": "artin", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "07X3", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$R$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$R$", "MATH_0004": "$\\Spec(R) \\to S$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:2dba4b13a4f061445a7efc6e48a63d6446dcd39b4e2a7c13160a39ff3ba27095", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:93a65eff30306c4e236f93ac063fd740b9220a7d15cba60d01eba6a42648e7fb", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIn this section we transfer some of the notions already defined\nin the chapter ``Formal Deformation Theory'' to the current setting.\nIn the following we will say ``<MATH_0001> is an <MATH_0002>-algebra'' to indicate\nthat <MATH_0003> is a ring endowed with a morphism of schemes <MATH_0004>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:80bc026673a7e8a244069a4d3f9f4ab87db5ebdd291a299f8f0d6881749f0e04", "unit_id": "tag:07X3:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "artin", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "07X3", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$p : \\mathcal{X} \\to (\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\xi = (R, \\xi_n, f_n)$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0005": "$S$", "MATH_0006": "$R$", "MATH_0007": "$\\xi_n$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0009": "$\\Spec(R/\\mathfrak m_R^n)$", "MATH_0010": "$f_n : \\xi_n \\to \\xi_{n + 1}$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0012": "$\\Spec(R/\\mathfrak m^n) \\to \\Spec(R/\\mathfrak m^{n + 1})$", "MATH_0013": "$R/\\mathfrak m$", "MATH_0014": "$S$", "MATH_0015": "$a : \\xi = (R, \\xi_n, f_n) \\to \\eta = (T, \\eta_n, g_n)$", "MATH_0016": "$a_n : \\xi_n \\to \\eta_n$", "MATH_0017": "$n$", "MATH_0018": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\xi_n \\ar[r]_{f_n} \\ar[d]_{a_n} & \\xi_{n + 1} \\ar[d]^{a_{n + 1}} \\\\\n\\eta_n \\ar[r]^{g_n} & \\eta_{n + 1}\n}\n$$", "MATH_0019": "$p$", "MATH_0020": "$\\Spec(R/\\mathfrak m_R^n) \\to \\Spec(T/\\mathfrak m_T^n)$", "MATH_0021": "$a_0 : \\Spec(R) \\to \\Spec(T)$", "MATH_0022": "$S$", "MATH_0023": "$a$", "MATH_0024": "$a_0$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0003": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0003": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-formal-objects}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:4a8ca80e107b709347a4fdb26823e951c539327ac9d6517cdda64284190f2f60", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4cb2f5a6c9b0838a0bf1f47e4855b3ea2ba300809ee27f46bd3c7ce424ecc733", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a locally Noetherian scheme. Let\n<MATH_0002> be a category fibred in groupoids.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> A <TEXTITOPEN_0001>formal object<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> <MATH_0003> of <MATH_0004> consists\nof a Noetherian complete local <MATH_0005>-algebra <MATH_0006>, objects <MATH_0007> of\n<MATH_0008> lying over <MATH_0009>, and morphisms\n<MATH_0010> of <MATH_0011> lying over\n<MATH_0012>\nsuch that <MATH_0013> is a field of finite type over <MATH_0014>.\n<STRUCT_0003> A <TEXTITOPEN_0002>morphism of formal objects<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>\n<MATH_0015>\nis given by morphisms <MATH_0016> such that for every <MATH_0017>\nthe diagram\n<MATH_0018>\nis commutative. Applying the functor <MATH_0019> we obtain a compatible collection\nof morphisms <MATH_0020> and\nhence a morphism <MATH_0021> over <MATH_0022>. We say that\n<MATH_0023> <TEXTITOPEN_0003>lies over<TEXTITCLOSE_0003> <MATH_0024>.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5c8bc22e17f4f1f54e3bf00ca69f88efb62efabe06a34516f8ef0a8c77b53a13", "unit_id": "tag:07X4:statement"}
{"chapter": "artin", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "07X3", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:0002d42c2adc9172acb55958a77085974084083df107126b40344a331769e8cc", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3cd90b063efd836404939ad437aec8c8e51e938ad2811f1ac8943fd7d86f2fda", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThus we obtain a category of formal objects of <MATH_0001>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:aecabff5a610adbaab578bca6cdd8e059c0135d91f0fd9499648ad03e1c93acd", "unit_id": "tag:07X3:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "artin", "node_kind": "remark", "parent_tag": "07X3", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$p : \\mathcal{X} \\to (\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\xi = (R, \\xi_n, f_n)$", "MATH_0004": "$k = R/\\mathfrak m$", "MATH_0005": "$x_0 = \\xi_1$", "MATH_0006": "$\\xi$", "MATH_0007": "$\\xi$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{F}_{\\mathcal{X}, k, x_0}$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{F}_{\\mathcal{X}, k, x_0}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{definition-formal-objects}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{formal-defos-definition-formal-objects}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{section-predeformation-categories}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{remark}\n\\label{remark-formal-objects-match}\n", "suffix": "\\end{remark}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:601ce95b9474f5276f763bc7714d1c0f360550bfe07e1fd6f86c57c5f3a1a997", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1c3a3cf2c8ee9ce167adee3a1637d40860c8e8dc75d53c4e4cf90bb8d83ba23e", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a locally Noetherian scheme. Let\n<MATH_0002> be a category fibred in groupoids.\nLet <MATH_0003> be a formal object. Set <MATH_0004> and\n<MATH_0005>. The formal object <MATH_0006> defines a formal object\n<MATH_0007> of the predeformation category <MATH_0008>.\nThis follows immediately from\nDefinition <REF_0001> above,\nFormal Deformation Theory, Definition\n<REF_0002>,\nand our construction of the predeformation category\n<MATH_0009> in\nSection <REF_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:1e740151d45f7a6d1741fe9786360490d2adcaf3f37cfed09fb700e19c735119", "unit_id": "tag:0CXH:statement"}
